sequenceDiagram
%% Diagrama de secuencia: inicio de sesión - Norma 220501095
actor V as Visitante
participant Form as LoginPage (RHF+Zod)
participant Ctx as AuthContext
participant Svc as authService
participant API as POST /auth/login
participant DB as PostgreSQL

V->>Form: diligencia correo y contraseña
Form->>Form: valida esquema Zod<br/>(email, min 6)
Form->>Ctx: login({email, password})
Ctx->>Svc: POST /auth/login
Svc->>API: credenciales
API->>DB: SELECT user + bcrypt.compare
DB-->>API: usuario válido
API-->>Svc: 200 {accessToken, user}
Svc-->>Ctx: AuthResponse
Ctx->>Ctx: localStorage + setUser
Ctx->>V: navega a / + toast implícito
